{"_id":"68a736238ec3d8323af1992c","nodeId":"y7KjVfSI6CAduyHd4mBFT","roadmapSlug":"kubernetes","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:15.590Z","description":"# Kubernetes Introduction\n\nKubernetes is an open-source container orchestration platform that automates the deployment, scaling, and management of containerized applications. It provides a way to abstract the underlying infrastructure and manage applications at scale, while also offering flexibility, portability, and a rich feature set. Kubernetes has become the de facto standard for container orchestration due to its widespread adoption, active community, and ability to handle complex, multi-tiered applications.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Kubernetes Documentation","url":"https://kubernetes.io/","_id":"6a7f4aadcb44947debcf9125"},{"type":"article","title":"Introduction of Kubernetes","url":"https://www.digitalocean.com/community/tutorials/an-introduction-to-kubernetes","_id":"6a7f4aadcb44947debcf9126"},{"type":"video","title":"Kubernetes Tutorial for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X48VuDVv0do","_id":"6a7f4aadcb44947debcf9127"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about Kubernetes","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/kubernetes?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f4aadcb44947debcf9128"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:04:45.052Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0416f04","title":"DataCamp - Introduction to Kubernetes","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/R0D14R"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0416f8c","title":"DataCamp - Containerization and Virtualization","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/n4g6RM"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/kubernetes/content/y7KjVfSI6CAduyHd4mBFT.md"}